Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.37,0:01:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The four Battle City finalists\Nare now being transported to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.47,0:01:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the top of the tower for the\Nfirst duel of the semi-finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Our shadow game awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.77,0:01:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're prepared to be\Nswallowed up by the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep dreaming, Psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I can defeat\NYugi and reclaim my glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to crush Kaiba to get to Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way I can save\Nthe world from destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel starts now! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it or miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.07,0:01:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the door, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.29,0:01:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just take off like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.95,0:01:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's gotta tell Serenity\Nher brother's about to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.85,0:01:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll just go! Bye, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This tower's high-tech!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:02:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me know, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.75,0:02:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.51,0:02:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone needs to help keep an eye on mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish Joey luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick Ishtar and Joey Wheeler\Nwill face off in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, chump, I'm going\Nto enjoy taking you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's my fan club?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want them here so they\Ncan witness your defeat, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.65,0:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When your mind is engulfed by the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.59,0:02:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be glad that no\None was here to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:02:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This shouldn't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If Joey is defeated by Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,he could end up losing more\Nthan just this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He could lose his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, this is going to be the most difficult\Nand dangerous duel you've ever fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, Merrick's got no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crush that creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be out of this tournament\Nbefore he can say freak show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't beat Merrick if he\Nwas blindfolded and handcuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for his Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not remember this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.57,0:03:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but I went up against Marek's\Nwinged dragon of Ra once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,pal, and I did just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If memory serves me, that Egyptian\Ngod card knocked you out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can defeat Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kaiba, the winged dragon of Ra holds\Nsecrets that none of us understand yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've uncovered the secrets of Ra. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,While you geeks were asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,my computer was translating the\NEgyptian writing that no one else could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't you try reading the text?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For perhaps you're in need of a lesson in\Nthe ancient Egyptian scriptures, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got me trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't I read the\Ntext and regain control of Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Great beast of the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hear my cry. Transform\Nthyself from orb of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.51,0:04:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And bring me victory in this\Nfight Unlock your powers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,from deep within So that\Ntogether we may win Appear in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,this shadow game as I call\Nyour name Winged Dragon of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, my great beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read it. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That Egyptian text is\Ncompletely clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read that paragraph as\Nif it were written in English,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.19,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've never seen that\Nlanguage before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal, so your computer\Nfigured it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling there's\Nmore to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Kaiba's connection to the\Nancient past somehow helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can\Ndefeat the winged dragon of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're going to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Fat chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last person I'd ever help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be watching your duel\Nagainst Maric very closely so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can test my own strategy and\Ntake him down in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I defeat Yugi in the semifinals,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gain ownership of\NSlifer the Sky Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me two Egyptian\Ngod cards in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be ready to face Marek, once\Nyou've served as my lab rat, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.21,0:05:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no lab rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.13,0:05:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that an amateur like you made it\Nthis far in my tournament boggles my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the bright side, at least\Nyou're serving a purpose wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching you lose to\NMarek will help me perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,my plan to crush his winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I mention you're getting on my nerves?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you think you have the rest\Nof this tournament figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order for this scheme of yours\Nto work, you have to get past me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows it's true, Yook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll soon find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Our duel is next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, Wheeler has a battle to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what did we miss, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.35,0:06:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.95,0:06:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Kaiba bugging you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse us, Sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's in a cheerful mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta keep my cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's just playing mind games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to ignore him and\Nfocus on taking down Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:07:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be tough, but I didn't get\Nwhere I am by taking it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I crushed some of the strongest duelists\Naround to get to the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, this is about more\Nthan just winning a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about keeping a\Npromise I made to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to show Merrick that no one messes\Nwith my friends and gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you're going down, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The first duel of the\Nsemifinals is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To my left, Merrick Ishtar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,To my right, Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit this, wacko, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing left\Nfor me to do but wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is in the hands of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:07:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Gilgarth in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall place one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here, you nutcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off to a bad start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,His Gilgoth has 1,800 attack points\Nand none of my cards can beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll summon my\Nalligator sword in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to take this\Nduel to the next level. Next level?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.19,0:08:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where this is going I was\Nafraid Merrick would do this Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,again? Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's now a shadow game
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.91,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some originality, Merrick
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows hunger for your mind\Nand your soul You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what's that I see in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's the look of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.91,0:09:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear that you're about to join\Nyour friend in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, she'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She's permanently trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And with each passing second,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,another portion of her mind\Nis absorbed into the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, please, tell us where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear those screams?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.45,0:09:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the helpless\Ncries of your friend Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And the weaker she gets,\Nthe stronger my powers grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.71,0:09:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let Joey go\Nthrough with this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what happened\Nwhen Merrick dueled Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.39,0:09:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's already made up his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you what he said to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.31,0:09:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have told you about this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey and I had a conversation\Nafter Mai's duel with Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.17,0:10:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know if I beat that evil freak\Nin a duel, I can get Mai back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.11,0:10:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been more sure\Nof anything in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.95,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe it to Mai and to\Nmyself to face Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I back away from this fight now,\NI'll never be able to forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.75,0:10:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave Mai my word that I wouldn't\Nlet anything happen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And Joey Wheeler would never\Nbreak a promise to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So look out, Maric, cause here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So Joey's trying to rescue Mai out\Nthere, and nothing we say can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something\Nwe can do to save Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.91,0:10:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he promised to bring back\NMai, but there has to be another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it's his fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as Joey made a promise to Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We made a promise to Joey that we would\Nstop protecting him. We must prove
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to Joey that we believe in him by\Nletting him duel on his own We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust him, Yugi He can win, but\Nhe needs our faith and support
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.01,0:11:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta beat Maric at his own\Ntwisted game, or lose my mind trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do this. Bring it\Non. I'm ready for your Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,game do you have any idea what\Nyou're about to experience i
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,doubt it the ancient dark magic\Ni've conjured will devastate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.37,0:11:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you you poor soul my move you\Nmay have seen the power of the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.37,0:11:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,shadows before but as the\Nenergies within me grow so does
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the strength of my shadow magic\Nare you here to talk or are
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You here to duel? Aren't you\Nthe least bit curious how this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow game will differ from\Nthe one that your friend lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,As always,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the loser of the duel will\Nbe banished to the shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Realm for eternity. But\Nthere's a bit more. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.77,0:12:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll soon find out. And then, mark my\Nwords, you'll wish you never faced me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey can't let Merrick keep messing\Nwith his head like this Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.69,0:12:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all part of Merrick's warped mind\Ngame Don't let him get to you, Joey Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to rumble, you big freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.87,0:12:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let the shadow game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You mind telling me why this thing\Nis connecting me to my monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you that this\Nduel was a bit different?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to raise the stakes by adding\Nthese energy streams to our game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, whenever your monster's attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,your body will be drained of a little more\Nenergy, leaving you weaker than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,With great pleasure, Mr. Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon Drillago in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Drillago, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:13:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his alligator\Nsword and grade his energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate test of his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.69,0:13:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So this duel's got a little twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But it can work against you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't realize that my inner\Nstrength is far superior to his.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gilgoth, attack his life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.57,0:13:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my scapegoat\Nmagic card to protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And since my scapegoat's not a monster\Ncard, there's no energy stream to zap me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move, Joey. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks as though\NI've underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.91,0:13:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I will. Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.55,0:14:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Read it and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now I summon my good buddy, Panther\NWarrior, to the field in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a taste of your own medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sacrifice one scapegoat to jump-start\Nmy panda and attack your gilgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That one was for Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.31,0:14:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of your friend Mai,\Nher mind should be empty by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your head games won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.41,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.81,0:14:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had your fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but now, it's time for me to end all\Nthat with this, my Tribute Burial card!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can bring one monster back from\Neach of our graveyards and sacrifice them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to summon an even stronger creature to\Ndrain whatever's left of your strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:14:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice you to summon\Nthis, the mighty Helpoemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.71,0:15:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can assure you that this new monster\Nof mine is more than he appears to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.11,0:15:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got the same strength\Nas my Dark Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless it has a hidden ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find out, or I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown and then end my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't Merrick attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be up to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for me to put you in your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome! It's Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This bad boy can rearrange his\NHell Poema's face one, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He could have blasted my scapegoat\Nlast turn and he held back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He must want me to\Nattack his Hell Poemora.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so he can spring its\Nspecial ability on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't risk my Jinzo just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Rocket Warrior in Attack Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell directly into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Face Down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,By summoning a monster in Attack Mode, you\Nactivated my Hidden Soldier's Trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This gives me the ability to summon\Nany monster with four stars or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my Plasma Eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll activate its special\Nability, the power of Plasma Grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for the fun part!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When my eel attaches itself to a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it lowers that monster's strength,\Nso your panther loses 500 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And according to the\Nrules of our Shadow Game,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,as your monster is drained of\Nits energy, so are you, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:16:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight it, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, are you beginning\Nto regret dueling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up on you, Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about me! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, link the dragon on Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy them both!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be okay, Mai. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.99,0:17:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I never break a promise to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never break my spirit, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.23,0:17:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That evil creep can drain my\Nphysical strength all he wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but he'll never drain my determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave Mai my word that I'd rescue\Nher, and there's no way I'm giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool should be begging for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as long as I have\Nsomething to fight for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Rocket Warrior's special ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Invincible mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his Hell Poema!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did he drain that monster's\Nstrength, he drained Merrick's too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.89,0:18:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll sacrifice Scapegoat,\Nletting Panther Warrior strike back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Slice and dice his Hell Poema!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.49,0:18:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,By attacking my beast, you\Ncaused your own demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When you sent my help-o-ever\Nto the card graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you activated my\Nmonster's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's its special ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, my boy, for\Nyou're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.87,0:18:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I doubt you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.09,0:19:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in your graveyard now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It gets much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it can destroy you from within\Nyour own dual disc. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going to destroy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to learn Help-O-Ever's\Nspecial ability. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Say farewell to a random\Ncard from your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.59,0:19:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'm afraid there's\Nplenty more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.47,0:19:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For as long as my Help-O-Emma\Nremains in your card graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll lose one card every turn. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If he keeps losing cards from his\Nhand, Joey will never beat Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.85,0:19:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is even more amusing than my\Nduel against your friend, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end, I'm afraid your fate\Nwill be exactly the same as hers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,an eternity in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.55,0:19:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
